1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,000
Every new agent session starts from zero.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,200
Hypnotist fixes that.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,000
Install it with one command.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Hand it a brief and a checkout.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Haiku writes the session history:
the role, the task, the context.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Then resume it in Claude Code or Codex,

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,000
and pick up where the work left off.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Hypnotist. Open source, MIT licensed.
